long-standing belief that government is here to serve not the richest and most powerful, not those who can hire armies of lobbyists and lawyers, but here to serve the people who are trying to build a future for themselves and their families. John and I were a good match, and I will say that, when I'm not saying, as part of that, that we always saw our next moves the same way.

[[00:02:40.820]]
